<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 23 May <span class="n">7</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/henry-v-holy-roman-emperor"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/henry-v-holy-roman-emperor.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Henry V, Holy Roman Emperor</span><span class="tp">1086–1125</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/girolamo-savonarola"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/girolamo-savonarola.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Girolamo Savonarola</span><span class="tp">1452–1498</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ismail-i"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ismail-i.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ismail I</span><span class="tp">1487–1524</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ferdinando-ii-de-medici"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ferdinando-ii-de-medici.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ferdinando II de' Medici</span><span class="tp">1610–1670</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/kit-carson"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/kit-carson.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Kit Carson</span><span class="tp">1809–1868</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/leopold-von-ranke"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/leopold-von-ranke.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Leopold von Ranke</span><span class="tp">1795–1886</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/heinrich-himmler"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/heinrich-himmler.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Heinrich Himmler</span><span class="tp">1900–1945</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
